WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.890
Captain brings the entire match week
into one trusted team workflow.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.500
See who is ready, compare lineup scenarios,
scout the matchup,

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.700
and send a plan your players can understand.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.000
Spend less time chasing answers in group texts,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.760
and more time making the team decision
with confidence.
